    "time in range distribution" : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "time in range distribution"
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "distribución del tiempo en rango"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Wearer and Default decide the ranges, the time shown, the rings, the lines, the last treatment, the sensor countdown and when to alert; Custom lets you set them on this Mac. Sounds, the no-data alert, the notification's buttons and each place's own time shown and sensor time are always this Mac's." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Wearer and Default decide the ranges, the time shown, the rings, the lines, the last treatment, the sensor countdown and when to alert; Custom lets you set them on this Mac. Sounds, the no-data alert, the notification's buttons and each place's own time shown and sensor time are always this Mac's."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Quien lleva el sensor y Predeterminados deciden los rangos, el tiempo mostrado, los anillos, las líneas, el último tratamiento, la cuenta atrás del sensor y cuándo avisar; Personalizados te deja ajustarlos en este Mac. Los sonidos, la alerta de sin datos, los botones de la notificación y el tiempo mostrado y el tiempo del sensor de cada lugar son siempre de este Mac."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "This Mac's ranges, time shown, rings, lines, last treatment, sensor countdown and alert rules become theirs, as a starting point to change. Sounds and the other settings of this Mac stay." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "This Mac's ranges, time shown, rings, lines, last treatment, sensor countdown and alert rules become theirs, as a starting point to change. Sounds and the other settings of this Mac stay."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Los rangos, el tiempo mostrado, los anillos, las líneas, el último tratamiento, la cuenta atrás del sensor y las reglas de alerta de este Mac pasan a ser los suyos, como punto de partida para cambiarlos. Los sonidos y los demás ajustes de este Mac se quedan."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The time shown, the rings, the lines, the ranges, the last treatment and the sensor settings go back to their defaults." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "The time shown, the rings, the lines, the ranges, the last treatment and the sensor settings go back to their defaults."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "El tiempo mostrado, los anillos, las líneas, los rangos, el último tratamiento y los ajustes del sensor vuelven a sus valores predeterminados."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "A ring over the main ring counts down the sensor's last hours. The warm-up and Sensor ended show either way." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "A ring over the main ring counts down the sensor's last hours. The warm-up and Sensor ended show either way."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Un anillo sobre el anillo principal cuenta atrás las últimas horas del sensor. El calentamiento y Sensor terminado se muestran igualmente."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Clockwise from 12 o'clock. Drag a range to move it, or Control-click it for Move Up and Move Down." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Clockwise from 12 o'clock. Drag a range to move it, or Control-click it for Move Up and Move Down."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "En el sentido de las agujas del reloj desde las 12. Arrastra un rango para moverlo, o haz clic con Control para Subir y Bajar."
          }
        }
      }
    },
